{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「啊，是吗……都没注意到」", "steam": "「啊，這樣啊……沒注意到。」"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 14}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "好像是在我打扫卫生期间濑名去樱乃的房间找她玩了。", "steam": "在我打掃房間的時候，瀨名來找櫻乃玩了。"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「濑名今天不用打工的吗……？」", "steam": "「瀨名，今天沒有打工嗎……？」"}, "length": {"chs": 15, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.526}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "话说回来，樱乃招待朋友来家里玩也是少见，\\n这也是濑名第一次到我家来吧。", "steam": "不過櫻乃會找朋友來家裡還真稀奇，瀨名是第一個。"}, "length": {"chs": 36, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.296}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "为了不打扰她们，我是不是应该窝在自己房间里比较好……", "steam": "我還是窩在房間不要打擾她們比較好吧……"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.45}
