{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「既然是熟人到家里来做客，\\n　果然还是去打个招呼为好吧……嗯，就这样」", "steam": "「不過認識的人來家裡，不打聲招呼也說不過去……好。」"}, "length": {"chs": 36, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.286}
