{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "爱理", "steam": "愛理"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "愛理"}, "voice": {"chs": "ar0749", "steam": "ar0749", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「虽然我按照短信的指示，\\n　在烟草店那里转弯了……」", "steam": "「我照郵件上說的，在香菸店前的紅綠燈過馬路後轉彎了，可是……」"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.261}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "樱乃", "steam": "桜乃"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "櫻乃"}, "voice": {"chs": "sk0387", "steam": "sk0387", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「爱理大概是在那个有很多自贩机的地方转弯了」", "steam": "「愛理大概是在有很多自動販賣機的地方轉彎了。」"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.65}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "爱理", "steam": "愛理"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "愛理"}, "voice": {"chs": "ar0750", "steam": "ar0750", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「不是吧？！那里不是烟草店吗？」", "steam": "「騙人！？那裡不是香菸店嗎？」"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.381}
